 - **Errors:** `unauthorized` (401) without a valid access token; `forbidden` (403) `PASSWORD_CHANGE_REQUIRED` while a temporary password is pending.
 
+#### `GET /manage/spaces/:spaceId` · 🧾
+ - **Access:** the caller must have an active `OWNER` or `RECEPTION` link to the space. A hidden
+   space remains available; a soft-deleted or unknown space, and a caller without a link, answer
+   `not_found` (404) without revealing whether the space exists. An `ADMIN` uses the `/admin`
+   routes and is not admitted by the managed-space route without a space link.
+ - **200:** the same `AdminSpace` shape used by the admin's single-space read: the profile, all
+   fact groups, freshness dates, missing and stale groups, and `isVerified`. Reception is
+   read-only.
+
+#### Managed space writes · 🏢
+ `OWNER` only, on a verified space: `PATCH /manage/spaces/:spaceId` edits the profile;
+ `PUT /manage/spaces/:spaceId/{hours|prices|amenities|contacts}` saves one fact group; and
+ `POST /manage/spaces/:spaceId/{group}/confirm` confirms one fact group. The response is the
+ updated `AdminSpace`; the validation, audit actions and lock rules are the same as the admin's
+ routes. Reception and callers without an active link are refused as above.
+
+#### Managed photos · 🏢 / 🧾
+ `GET /manage/spaces/:spaceId/photos` is available to the owner and reception. The owner may
+ `POST` a photo, `DELETE /manage/spaces/:spaceId/photos/:photoId`, and
+ `PUT /manage/spaces/:spaceId/photos/order`; these reuse the admin photo service, upload
+ limit and storage rules. A photo upload is limited before its file is read.
+
